This Element is not met as evidenced by:

Based on document review and staff interview, it was determined that the facility failed to ensure that patients are informed of changes in the care to be furnished.

Findings include:

1. Patient #1 resumed home health services on 11/22/18. The resumption of care physician orders dated 11/22/18, indicated, "... HHA [home health aide] effective 11/25/2018 1WK1 [once during the week]."

a. Review of documentation provided revealed that on 11/29/18, a home health aide visit was scheduled, however, this visit was not made.

b. The agency failed to ensure that the patient/caregiver was informed in a timely manner that a visit would not be made. 

c. The above was confirmed by Staff #2.

